609 0 obj
<<
/Title (Active Graph-Based Monitoring: The system incorporates a dedicated Deadlock Monitor that maintains a real-time state of the simulation. By tracking "held" and "requested" resources for every thread, it constructs a Wait-for Graph to proactively detect circular dependencies.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 605 0 R
/Next 606 0 R
>>
endobj
